Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:58.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\pos(565,1065)}我依然笑顏綻放 心動不已滿懷期待
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:03.45,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\pos(565,1065)}最想說的是一句「早安」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:05.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(200,200)\pos(565,1065)}直到永遠
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------TITLE------------------
