Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\bord0\1c&F\blur1.1\shad0\1a50\fs20\t(0,7470,\fs23)\an1\frx348\fry350\frz332.9\move(719.429,787.486,612.229,795.486,26,7450)\fax0.3}話說，這肯定是什麼伏筆吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\bord0\1c&F\blur1.1\shad0\1a50\fs20\t(0,7470,\fs23)\an1\frx348\fry350\frz332.7\move(732.933,881.924,624.133,907.524,26,7450)\fax0.3}剛開播沒幾話就出這種內容，\N這若是補救措施也太早了，總之下週也一定要看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\bord0\1c&F\blur1.1\shad0\1a50\fs20\t(0,7470,\fs23)\an1\frx348\fry350\frz330.8\move(689.333,952,575.733,990.4,26,7450)\fax0.3}本季的好作品真多欸！真的喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&H002E3D99\bord0\fs25\frz331.1\pos(669.096,600.381)\blur1.2}也許你身邊的人是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&H002E3D99\bord0\fs25\frz331.1\blur1.2\pos(746.057,744)}↓回答下面的問題↓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(572.572,725.486)}白天是不是不出門？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(532,769.333)}晚上卻很有精神？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(534.629,883.657)}吃飯的時候總是喝「番茄汁」？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(469.714,917.714)}實際比看起來要有力氣？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(395.2,944)}討厭泳池或海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(342.667,988)}不接觸陽光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn更紗黑體 TC\1c&HD2C6B2&\bord0\fs23\blur1.2\frz330.3\pos(356.571,1080.915)}過了很多年容貌也不會變
