Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H00191C4E\shad0\fs50\1a30\move(737.333,488,714.933,480,23,7447)\b1}濃厚AB
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H002F425C\shad0\fs50\1a20\move(1169.333,490.666,1194.933,484.266,23,5612)\b1}爽滑O
